# QA screenshot output. Narrow on purpose — M7 is a design-system milestone and
# a blanket *.png would silently swallow real assets.
.playwright-mcp/
# QA screenshots. Visual evidence for a milestone or a feature is recorded in the
# plan or the record that cites it; the image itself stays local, which is why the
# six m0–m7 milestone screenshots were never committed.
# Still narrow on purpose — anchored to the repo root only, so a real asset inside
# public/ or docs/ is never silently swallowed. Widened from `/m[0-9]-*.png` once
# post-v1 features started producing screenshots too (0017's folder-scope pair).
/*.png

# Your real source list maps your machine (record 0021). Copy sources.example.json.
sources.json

# Backups of untracked-but-precious config (0021 removed the checkout safety net).
*.bak
